<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1PE" style="id">- Ibaas</book>
  <para style="h">1 ABitrus</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Bit</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 ABitrus</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kufumung imɛsɛng fɛ́ aBitrus Jɛk</para>
  <para style="mt1">1 ABitrus</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kufumung imɛsɛng <optbreak /> fɛ́ aBitrus Jɛk</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1PE 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 1:1" />Kufumung kang ne ni imi aBitrus, atom aYeso Kristi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 1:1">Sak na bayɔng fɛ́ Adakunom kasa, fɛ́ ba yet batsen azatse kang, fɛ́ ba se sharatat ni mben aPɔntus, na aGalati, na aKapadokiya, na Asiya, nɛ aBitiniya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">I se gyat ni i rēn yin fok ngma narɔ me nang se na aTɔki.</char></note>, <verse eid="1PE 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 1:2" />bayɔng fɛ́ ayɛt irēn gyam Ada Adakunom a ka ba kasa ni irèn ikanang fɛ́ Kabik, nek ifok ifɛ̀ ba na aYeso Kristi ni iwaat nasok wu:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 1:2">Won itek ni kusot kukyang ni ku se ni yin sherek.<verse eid="1PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Itere sak na Adakunom <optbreak /> nek kusot ite iyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 1:3" />Won itere ni i sot ifɛ́ Adakunom, Ada aTisa yit aYeso Kristi! Nek kudot angmishish wu a mi ki nɔɔk yit kutset kufas ni ite iyɛ makiyi fi i ne ayɛt idorok ifaben aYeso Kristi ni irɛk, <verse eid="1PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 1:4" />sak ni isɛ iya itekari fɛ́ ba ki sak yin ne azanɛn, fi ise cɛ́l, vit ibeseng, fi da in bush awo, <verse eid="1PE 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 1:5" />fɛ́ ba mi ki nyiit yit ayɛt abik nɛ agap Adakunom, sak ma kubɛ́ isheshek yit fi i bi bɛ́ atuk igang e. <verse eid="1PE 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 1:6" />Fi i sak i di nye yin iyɛ ikan, ngma ni nzam-nzam mgbang fi ki sot gbing ni i sɔ yin yɔkɔnɔng nfi kizen gyet.<verse eid="1PE 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 1:7" />Ikyɛng e tsin te anɔng, nɔng ba di ki mara inɔɔk atsak yin fi i wat atsɔm-aseng ni kusas, ina fɛ́ a nye kpedek ngma ni ikanang ina fɛ́ ba nye ni kurong. Anɔng e da sak ba di rēn atitup inɔɔk atsak yin fi i bi ki bɛ yin ni itere, ni ízɔk, ni iratek ni izen fɛ́ aYeso Kristi bi bɛ́ wu. <verse eid="1PE 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 1:8" />Ngma ne fi imang ku di yin awo, i kushim yin; ngma na fi i tsin ku yere yin yɔkɔnɔng awo, i di nɔɔk yin atsak ni wu, ibɛ yin ifeng fi i wat agap icɛɛt, <verse eid="1PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 1:9" />nek i tsin sɛs yin izang inɔɔk atsak yin, isheshek kutset yin.<verse eid="1PE 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 1:10" />Naton isheshek e yeng fɛ́ batan kin tsɛt tsik ayɛt nhwyɛ, ba ma tak ibes itek Adakunom fi i da bɛ́ ni yin. <verse eid="1PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 1:11" />Kabik Anet-Isheshek ayɛt ayɛ bá kin tsang ka ba tak fok, Anet-Isheshek me da sɔ izot ninyɛn, a da ma sɛ iratek. Nek anɔng, ba shim ba rēn izen ni irén fi ikyɛng e bi te. <verse eid="1PE 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 1:12" />Ba kin ka ba tonong ide fok, da ba kin se kutomong ice bà awo, tit iyin ba. Ni izen fɛ́ ba kin cɛɛt naton nkyɔrɔk nang fɛ́ bayɔng fɛ́ ba kin ki shara yin ifɛ̀ itek ni irèn Kabik aJɛrɛ fɛ́ ka ne azanɛn. Batomaza ice bà kin tsɛt ku di nkyɔrɔk e nang.<verse eid="1PE 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sot yin Jɛrɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 1:13" />Nek anɔng, ka na nye yin nek kutomong, tekap yin ace yin; te yin iyɛ nek isɛ yin itek fɛ́ ba bi ki nɔɔk yin ni izen ibɛ aYeso Kristi. <verse eid="1PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 1:14" />Ti nnon fɛ́ na foos ifɛ̀, i bi ti inɔ yin ni amaan ikɔk irɔm fi i tsang bɛ̀ yin ni izen fi i se yin ni idun awo, <verse eid="1PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 1:15" />tit tɛ ayɔng fɛ́ a ki yes yin di se jɛrɛ, won iyin ace yin ni i sot yin jɛrɛ na akaakyi fi i da nye yin. <verse eid="1PE 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 1:16" />Nek i se ni ijɛk ye, &lt;&lt;Sot yin jɛrɛ, nek imi se jɛrɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1PE 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 1:17" />Ayet fok iyin yes Ada fɛ́ a ras ishɔt kutomong akaakyɛ anet vit ishim ice, nye yin kusot yin tɛ batsen azeng ayɛt nnyim Adakunom. <verse eid="1PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 1:18" />Nek iyin rēn yin fok da ni nkyɔrɔk fi in nye kpedek tɛ atsɔm-aseng wu fɛ́ ba kin ki shan yin mo awo, ayɛt irèn kusot ibeseng fɛ́ badakop yin kin ki nabak yin ne awo, <verse eid="1PE 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 1:19" />tit na nasok natek nafɛ́ aKristi, kitsamang fɛ́ ka se vit karìk ke ibeseng ayi. <verse eid="1PE 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 1:20" />Ba kin ku myak neme dang na ba tumung kazatse, awɛt ba nɛ ba ku tonong ni nnom igang e nang mok iyin. <verse eid="1PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 1:21" />Ni wu fi iyin di nɔɔk yin atsak na Adakunom, fɛ́ a ku donong ni irɛk, a ku nɔɔk iratek, nek anɔng atsak yin ni ite iyɛ yin se ne Adakunom.<verse eid="1PE 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 1:22" />Yɔkɔnɔng fi i mi kanang yin ace yin, nek ifok ifɛ̀ na atsak, fi i sak ibɛ yin atitup ishim sak na bafidang, tonoso yin bafidang ishim itsik fi ines ayɛt ayɛ yin. <verse eid="1PE 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 1:23" />Nek ba mi tɛ ba ki tes yin, da ni ica fi i mi ku awo, tit ni ifɛ̀ Adakunom itsɛt, fi i di nak. <verse eid="1PE 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 1:24" />Nek,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">&lt;&lt;Ngma banet se tɛ agam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 1:24">iratek bá gaas tɛ ashoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 1:24">agam ayit.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">Agam e koot nɛ ashoy e kpas,<verse eid="1PE 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 1:25" />awɛt ifɛ̀ Adakunom</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 1:25">da nak ayɛ nɛ ayɛ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 1:25">Ifɛ̀ me deng, fɛ́ ba kin ki shara yin e.<verse eid="1PE 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1PE 2" />
  <para style="s">Kuta kutset nɛ banet fɛ́ <optbreak /> Adakunom myak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 2:1" />Nek anɔng, sak yin ace yin yik-yik na kaakyɛ kuri imaan e, ni mbɔɔs, ni kutomong ayisi, ni ifup, ni itok. <verse eid="1PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 2:2" />Ti nnon nafas fɛ́ ba tes, tsɛsɛk yin nabasang abik natek fɛ́ na da sak isheshek yin ni i rasak, <verse eid="1PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 2:3" />yɔkɔnɔng fi i mi bamang yin fok aTisa yet atek.<verse eid="1PE 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutá kutset nɛ Banet <optbreak /> fɛ́ ba mi Kasa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 2:4" />Bɛ́ yin sak ni wu, iwu fɛ́ a yet kuta kutset, kuyɔng fɛ́ banet raba iko awɛt iko fɛ́ Adakunom myak, fi ku dung sas ashon wu, <verse eid="1PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 2:5" />iyin tɛ ata atset e bà, ba tsin ki nok yin tɛ kari abik, nɔng i da ra yin ntomong tɛ baware, i da nesek yin kunang abik fɛ́ Adakunom shim ni irèn aYeso Kristi. <verse eid="1PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 2:6" />Nek i se ni ijɛk ni Kufumung aJɛrɛ yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:6">&lt;&lt;Di, in mi te kuta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:6">na aSihiyona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:6">kuta fɛ́ ba myak, kuta itsok</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:6">itu kutek,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:6">Ngma ayɔng fɛ́</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:6">a di te iyɛ ni wu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:6">a da sɔ nsum awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1PE 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 2:7" />Ni iyin fi i nɔɔk atsak fok, kutá me kang yet kutek. Awɛt sak na bayɔng fɛ́ ba raba inɔɔk atsak,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:7">&lt;&lt;Kutá fɛ́ bafi inok</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:7">raba iko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:7">ku mi sot kuta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:7">fi ku dung sas.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1PE 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 2:8" />I ti se ni jɛk fok, bayɔng fɛ́ ba raba inɔɔk atsak,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:8">&lt;&lt;Kutá fi ku saas banet</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:8">di tu atak,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:8">kutá fi ku ka ba tes ikpas.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 2:8">Bayɔng fɛ́ ba raba me, ba nye kambush. Anɔng e wu ba mi sak nek iba.<verse eid="1PE 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 2:9" />Awɛt iyin yet yin banet fɛ́ ba mi kasa, bafɛ́ ari baware, banet ajɛrɛ, banet fɛ́ ba yet bafɛ́ Adakunom, nɔng i da taas yin itere ayɔng fɛ́ a ki tun yin ni nhwyi sak ni mgbey abes. <verse eid="1PE 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 2:10" />Iyin kin tsang yet yin banet awo, yɔkɔnɔng i yet yin banet, i kin se yin vit isɛ angmishish awɛt yɔkɔnɔng i mi sɛ yin angmishish.<verse eid="1PE 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 2:11" />Bafidang yin, in shim in fɛ̀ ni yin fok, tɛ batsen nɛ bafɛ́ amatse azeng azatse, teng yin imaan ikɔk, fi i se ni itsom ni kutset yin. <verse eid="1PE 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 2:12" />Nye yin kusot kutek nate bafi nhwyi nɔng, ngma ni ncɛɛt fɛ́ ba nye fok iras yin inɛn, ba da di ntomong ntek yin ne ba di nɔɔk Adakunom iratek ni izen i bɛ́ wu.<verse eid="1PE 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nasap yin ace yin sak <optbreak /> na bágwɔm nɛ batek ari yin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 2:13" />Nabak yin ace yin nek aTisa na akaakyi igwɔm fi ba te ide nate banet: ke na bágwɔm, nɛ agbat agwɔm, <verse eid="1PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 2:14" />ke sak na bagwɔmna, nek agbat agwɔm ka ba yirik nek itabak bafi inɛn nɛ ba tere bayɔng fɛ́ ba ras itek. <verse eid="1PE 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 2:15" />Nek i yet kushim Adakunom fok ayɛt kusot kutek yin, i da fam yin na nu bayɔng fɛ́ ba cɛɛt ni idun. <verse eid="1PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 2:16" />Nye yin kusot tɛ banet fɛ́ ba se washak, awɛt kusot iwashak yin bi ni ku sot ikyɛng ifamasa anyas awo; nye yin kusot tɛ basam Adakunom. <verse eid="1PE 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 2:17" />Nɔɔk yin akaangan iratek wu gyat; Tonoso yin ishim sak na bafidin bafi ikuus, foos yin nnyim Adakunom, nesek yin aGbat agwɔm iratek.<verse eid="1PE 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 2:18" />Basam, nabak yin ace yin sak na batek ari yin, ni iratek ayɛt akaakyɛ, da sak na bayɔng fɛ́ ba bɛ̀ nggɔn ntek ni nhwyɛ kyɛk awo, tit ngma ne bafi iyɛ ife. <verse eid="1PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 2:19" />Nek i se gyat ke anet te gbinding ayɛt mgbang naton inɛn fi da iwu ra awo, a sɔ mgbang e nek kuyiring fɛ́ a bɛ na Adakunom. <verse eid="1PE 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 2:20" />Awɛt na anɛ fi ngɔn da sɛ izang ki ngɔn sɔ itsot nek inɛn ni igbingding fi i nye yɛ? Awɛt ki ngɔn sɔ mgbang, i gbinding nek i nye ikyɛng itek, anɔng se gyat ashon Adakunom. <verse eid="1PE 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 2:21" />Nek anɔng wu fɛ́ ba da yes, nek Anet-Isheshek sɔ mgbang nek iyin, a ki won yin mo ikyɛng imɛɛs, nɔng i da kuus yin ane wu.<verse eid="1PE 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 2:22" />&lt;&lt;A kin ra inɛn awo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:22">ba kin sɛ mbɔɔs</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:22">na nu wu awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1PE 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 2:23" />Ni izen fɛ́ ba kin di korok itok ni wu, a ka ba bun ni itok awo; ni izen fɛ́ a kin sɔ mgbang, da a fɛ̀ a da ka ba bun ne awo. Tit, a te iyɛ wu na ayɔng fɛ́ a ras ishɔt atsak. <verse eid="1PE 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 2:24" />Iwu ice wu sok anɛn yit ni irɔm wu a ku ni ina naton ákon, nɔng in di ki kus yit na anɛn yit, ni in nye yit kusot kutabat; nek nfot wu, ba mi ki te yin kyang. <verse eid="1PE 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 2:25" />Nek iyin tsang se yin ti itsamang fi i tseng sak ayit, awɛt yɔkɔnɔng, i mi bun yin sak na Anek e nɛ Anet iyɛrɛ ntset yin.<verse eid="1PE 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1PE 3" />
  <para style="s">Banyining nɛ Bamatek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 3:1" />Banyining, ni irèn izining e, nabak yin ace yin sak na bamatek yin, nɔng ke akak bà nɔɔk atsak ni ifɛ̀ Adakunom me awo, ba da kyem ba ka ba tirik vit ifɛ̀ Adakunom me, ni nggɔn banyining bà ntek, <verse eid="1PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 3:2" />ke ba di kusot kucɛ́l yin, ni kusot nhwyɛ yin. <verse eid="1PE 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 3:3" />Da kusas yin bi ne ni nzem nrɔm fɛ́ ba yɛrɛ ti ibat ice, ni ites itsɔm ato ata asɛng, nɛ ares itsɔm awo, <verse eid="1PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 3:4" />tit, kusas fi ku nes ayɛt ayɛ yin, kusas fi da ku se tɔlɔt awo, tit imen iyɛ nɛ kabik nhwyɛ fi itek ko wat ashon Adakunom. <verse eid="1PE 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 3:5" />Nek irèn e yeng fɛ́ banyining ajɛrɛ ayame fɛ́ ba te iyɛ bá na Adakunom di sɛs kusas bá. Ba kin nasap ace bà sak na bamatek bà, <verse eid="1PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 3:6" />tɛ aSara, fɛ́ a foos ifɛ̀ aIbrahim, a ku yes atisa wu. Iyin yet yin bangas wu, ki i nye yin ikyɛng itek, da itarak yin irèn ni inyim awo.<verse eid="1PE 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 3:7" />Bamatek, ni irèn izining yɔng bà, bereng yin banyining ni hwyɛ, ka ba nesek yin iratek tɛ bayɔng fɛ́ agap bá sɛ te afiin awo, tɛ bafi iya itekari gung ni iyin nfi kunang kutset kutek, nɔng vit ikyɛng fi i da ro na awon yin.<verse eid="1PE 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isɔ izot nek ira ikyɛng itek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 3:8" />Ni igang e, won ngma yin ni moon yin ace na bafidang; foos yin angmishish bafidang, shim yin bafidang, sot yin ne angmishish nɛ imen ice. <verse eid="1PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 3:9" />I bi tarang anyas nɛ anyas awo, ke itok ni itok awo, tit ka ba tes yin awɛng, nek ba ki yes yin mok iya itekari awɛng, <verse eid="1PE 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 3:10" />nek,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:10">&lt;&lt;Ngma ayɔng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">fɛ́ a shim kutset wu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">a shim a di nnom ntek,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:10">i se gbing-gbing na a rosom</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">ilem wu ni ncɛɛt anyas,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:10">nɛ kanu wu wosong</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">ncɛɛt mbɔɔs.<verse eid="1PE 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 3:11" />I se gbing-gbing,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:11">na a won anyas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:11">na a ras itek.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:11">I se gbing-gbing,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:11">na tsɛt kusot kukyang</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:11">na di kuus iko.<verse eid="1PE 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 3:12" />Nek ayisi aTisa se naton</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:12">bafi kusot kutabat,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:12">ato wu tsin foos awon bá.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:12">Awɛt ayisi aTisa ra na</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:12">bayɔng fɛ́ ba ras anyas.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1PE 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 3:13" />Angan da a kyem a da man ki ifoos ikɔk i nye itek ɛ? <verse eid="1PE 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 3:14" />Awɛt ki i sot gbing ni i sɔ izot nek ikyɛng itek fi ira, ibɛ yin awɛng. &lt;&lt;I bi fok yin nnyim ikyɛng fi iba foos nnyim e awo; i bi te beke yin awo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1PE 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 3:15" />Tit te myak yin Anet-Isheshek aziwu ni yɛ yin tɛ aTisa yin. Kana nye yin nek itak akaangan fɛ́ a ki rip yin, ite iyɛ fi ibɛ yin. Awɛt nye yin anɔng ayɛt nhwyɛ, ni inesek iratek, <verse eid="1PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 3:16" />bereng yin kuyiring kutek, nɔng bayɔng fɛ́ ba nyes ncɛɛt nduk e azaton nggɔn ntek yin ayɛt Anet-Isheshek da sɔ nsum mbɔɔs bá.<verse eid="1PE 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 3:17" />I da dung se gyat ki i yet kushim Adakunom, ni i sɔ mgbang nek inye ikyɛng itek aza mgbang naton i nye anyas. <verse eid="1PE 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 3:18" />Nek Anet-Isheshek kin ku nek bafi inɛn ite kazizining pɛɛt, anet kusot kutabat nek bafi nhwyi, a ki kɔrɔk yin sak na Adakunom. Ba kin ku fɛt ni irɔm, awɛt ba ku te atset na Kabik, <verse eid="1PE 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 3:19" />na anɔng fɛ́ a tse a shara sak na nabik fɛ́ na se ni inyang, <verse eid="1PE 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 3:20" />fɛ́ na kin ra na ifok ifɛ̀ neme fɛ́ Adakunom kin woso tot na akabɔk ni nnom aNuhu na ba tsin nye kukyɛ ashi me. Ni ko banet gyeet, nkara kyɛk, fɛ́ ba kin hwyet ayɛt ashi me, <verse eid="1PE 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 3:21" />ashi me nang yet nawu abatisma fɛ́ a tsin ki sheshek yin bá, da ifi turung arik ni rɔm awo, tit ifi kushi inabak kuyiring kutek sak na Adakunom. I ki sheshek yin ni irèn idorok ifaben aYeso Kristi. <verse eid="1PE 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 3:22" />Iwu fɛ́ a mi ngarak sak azanɛn, a se ni bɔk iyak Adakunom, nɛ batomaza, nɛ bafi kukyem, nɛ bafi agap fɛ́ ba se aben ni wu.<verse eid="1PE 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1PE 4" />
  <para style="s">Nggɔn bafi ikuus Anet-Isheshek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 4:1" />Nek anɔng, ne fɛ́ Anet-Isheshek sɔ izot ni irɔm wu, sok yin ace yin anɔng bà ni nggɔn fi in se kpaf anɔng, nek iwu fɛ́ a mi sɔ mgbang e ni irɔm wu a mi gang ni inɛn. <verse eid="1PE 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 4:2" />Nek anɔng, iwu nye ishɛrɛp kusot wu azeng azatse nek amaan ikɔk banet awe awo, tit nek kushim Adakunom. <verse eid="1PE 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 4:3" />Nek iyin mi bɔ yin izen yame ni iras yin agbɛk-gbɛk fɛ́ bafi nhwyi kasa iras e, isosok yin ayɛt kusot ayit isɔ, nɛ amaan ikɔk, ni isɔ, aduk iro, ni ngbɛk-gbɛk nkyɔrɔk ni iya nabannom ntong. <verse eid="1PE 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 4:4" />Ikyɛng e ka ba se yɔɔt fi iyin rayin imoon ice ni ba ayɛt iras nkyɔrɔk ngbɛk-gbɛk e, nɛ ba ki korok yin ni itok. <verse eid="1PE 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 4:5" />Awɛt ba bi tak ikyɛng fɛ́ ba kin nye sak na ayɔng fɛ́ a mi kana nye a da ra batset nɛ bafaben ishɔt. <verse eid="1PE 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 4:6" />Nek anɔng wu, fɛ́ kin di shara ifɛ̀ itek sak na bayɔng fɛ́ ba man kus, nɔng ba bi ka ba ra ishɔt tɛ banet ni irɔm, awɛt ba bi nye kusot bá nabik ashon Adakunom.<verse eid="1PE 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 4:7" />Igang akaakyi ikyɛng mi bɛ́ bakat. Nek anɔng, tot yin ace yin, nɔng i da kyem ira yin awon. <verse eid="1PE 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 4:8" />Iratek e ngma yet shim yin bafidang ni iyɛ izining. Nek ishim famasa ihwyanang anɛn dot. <verse eid="1PE 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 4:9" />Shashang yin bafidang yɛɛt na nasa yin, vit itang kufɛk. <verse eid="1PE 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 4:10" />Kaangan na a ra kutomong ni kunang fɛ́ Adakunom nɔk tɛ anek atek fɛ́ na akaakyi irèn na di sɛs bafidang wu. <verse eid="1PE 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 4:11" />Ke akak tsin cɛɛt, won na a nye anɔng tɛ anet fɛ́ a tsin tees ifɛ̀ Adakunom kpaf-kpaf. Ke akak tsin ra kutomong, won na a nye anɔng ayɛt agap fɛ́ Adakunom nesek, nɔng ayɛt akaakyɛ Adakunom di ki sɛ itere ayɛt aYeso Kristi. Ízɔk nɛ agap ni isot afuu ayɛ na vit igang. Anɔng.<verse eid="1PE 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isɔ izot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 4:12" />Bacɛk iyɛ hom, ayɔɔt bi ki yit yin nek imara ifi mgbang fi i tsin sɔ yin awo, ti ikyɛng ikak ifas tsin te ni yin. <verse eid="1PE 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 4:13" />Tit ni nye yin iyɛ ikan nek fi i tsin sɔ yin izot Anet-Isheshek, nɔng i bi nye yin iyɛ ikan makiyi ni izen fɛ́ a bi bɛ a tonong ízɔk wu. <verse eid="1PE 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 4:14" />Ke ba ki tosong yin nek iyerek Anet-Isheshek, iyin bɛ yin awɛng, nek Kabik ízɔk nɛ Adakunom se ni yin. <verse eid="1PE 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 4:15" />Ke akak da sɔ mgbang, won da i bi yet nek ifɛt anet akak awo, kɛ nek itsang awo, kɛ nek amaan anet awo, kɛ nek inɔs ni ikyɛng fi kubɔk wu di se awo. <verse eid="1PE 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 4:16" />Ngma na anɔng, ke i sɔ mgbang tɛ bafi ikuus Anet-Isheshek, da i bi fok nsum awo, tit ni tere Adakunom nek ibɛ yin iyerek e dɔng. <verse eid="1PE 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 4:17" />Nek izen mi nye fi ishɔt da tumung na banet Adakunom; ki ishɔt e tumung ni iyit, ikyɛng e da te anɛ na bayɔng fɛ́ ba raba ifok ifɛ̀ itek Adakunom ɛ? <verse eid="1PE 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 4:18" />Ane,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 4:18">&lt;&lt;Ki i bi mgbang,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 4:18">anet kusot kutabat</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 4:18">na a hwyet.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 4:18">I bi sot anɛ na bayɔng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 4:18">fɛ́ ba raba kusot kutabat,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 4:18">nɛ bafi inɛn ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1PE 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 4:19" />Nek anɔng, bayɔng fɛ́ ba tsin sɔ mgbang ni irèn fɛ́ Adakunom shim, na ba nabak ice bá na afɛ́ atsak Anet inye bá, nɛ ba ya kashon ni iras itek.<verse eid="1PE 4:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1PE 5" />
  <para style="s">Bashɔn ikuus nɛ bacam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 5:1" />Sak na bashɔn nate yin, in tsin ra awon ni yin tɛ ashɔn kpaf ti iyin, Imi ice hom in yet ashon ti iyin. Imi yet afi icɛɛt naton mgbang fi in di Anet-Isheshek sɔ, nɛ ayɔng fɛ́ a bi sɛ kanu kafuu ni iratek fi i bi bɛ́: <verse eid="1PE 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 5:2" />Sot yin bafi tot banet Adakunom fɛ ba se ni bɔk yin, tɛ bafi iyɛrɛ itsamang, da tɛ ba ki te yin mo inɛn awo. Tit nek iyet ishim yin, kyɔn tɛ Adakunom di shim ni i sot yin; da bafi nhwyɛ itsɔm awo, tit nek iyɛ ingash ira kutomong, <verse eid="1PE 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 5:3" />i bi tsɛt yin iratek ni itek azaton bayɔng fɛ́ ba nabak ni bɔk yin awo, tit sot yin ikyɛng imɛɛs na banet e. <verse eid="1PE 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 5:4" />Wat ni izen fɛ́ agbat anek e bi bɛ́s wu, i bi shan yin abong ízɔk fɛ́ da a te tɔlɔt awo.<verse eid="1PE 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 5:5" />Bacam, kpaf anɔng bà, nabasa yin ace yin sak na bako ni iyin. Ngma yin, te yin ace yin ni imen nhwyɛ sak na bafidang, nek,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 5:5">&lt;&lt;Adakunom rawu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 5:5">bafi ikok ice,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 5:5">awɛt na nesek bafi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 5:5">imen ice itek wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1PE 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 5:6" />Nek anɔng, men yin ace yin, ni kukyem ibɔk Adakunom, nɔng a bi ki sok yin garang ni izen fi iwu di gyat. <verse eid="1PE 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 5:7" />Nabasa yin ndaam yin sak ni wu, nek iwu ki berese yin.<verse eid="1PE 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 5:8" />Yit yin ace yin, ni kana nye yin. Anet ifa yin aShetan tsin kat kaakɛ te akukum na tsɛsɛk anet fɛ́ a da ku ngɔɔt. <verse eid="1PE 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 5:9" />Ku rayin, nyeseng yin gak ni inɔɔk atsak yin, nek iyin rēn yin fok, bafidin ngma azatse se ni isɔ mgbang nzining e anɔng bà.<verse eid="1PE 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 5:10" />Adakunom fɛ́ a nesek kaakyi itek, fɛ́ a ki yes yin sak i sɛ iratek wu vit igang ayɛt aKristi Yeso, ama fi i mi sɔ yin mgbang nfi kizen gyet, a da tɛ a ki shining yin, na ki te yin agap, a da ki tup yin gak nɛ ki gbinding yin. <verse eid="1PE 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 5:11" />Agap yet afuu ayɛ na ayɛ. Anɔng.<verse eid="1PE 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ashow afi igang e</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 5:12" />Ni igbingding aSilvanus, fi in ku fa tɛ aruneng atsak, in ki jɛk yin e gyegyet, nek in ki gbinding yin, ni in ki tak yin fok, itek Adakunom fi in di nyeseng yit, iyet atsak. Nyeseng gak ni de. <verse eid="1PE 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 5:13" />Bayɔng fɛ́ ba se na aBabila, fɛ́ ba ka ba kasa gung ni iyin, ki te show yin nɛ arim hom aMarkus. <verse eid="1PE 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 5:14" />Nye show yin bafidang ni ishim ni irèn ashow bafi ikuus Anet-Isheshek. Won kusot kukyang ni kusot ni yin ngma fi i se yin na Kristi.<verse eid="1PE 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 5" />
</usx>